<title>LITHUANIA: Yields slump at 182-day Lithuania T-bill sale.</title>
<headline>Yields slump at 182-day Lithuania T-bill sale.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield at an auction of 182-day Treasury bills fell on Tuesday and demand exceeded supply, the central bank said.</p>
<p>All amounts are in millions of litas.  MATURITY   AV YIELD   LAST TIME   MIN/MAX   ISSUE  BID  SOLD</p>
<p> 182-day     7.16	 9.97	7.07/7.19   30   72.443 30</p>
<p>The settlement date for the auction was August 22 and the bills mature on February 20, 1998.</p>
<p>The next auction is on August 25, when 40 million litas of 91-day paper will be offered.</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 223 517</p>
</text>
